# A part of a cost that would make hidden information known is carried out as the cast is committed (the owner's ruling
# of 2026-11-21, docs/engine-design.md "Taking back an illegal action"), and where the payer pays it after the other steps
# nothing paid later could read it, so it waits. Bolas's Citadel casts Cosmogoyf and then Fling off the top of the
# library for life equal to their mana values, and Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator exiles that many cards from the top of the
# library instead (CR 119.4, 614.1a). Cosmogoyf's power is the number of cards Bot1 owns in exile (CR 604.3), and Fling
# deals damage equal to the power of the creature sacrificed for it (CR 608.2h), so the order of Fling's life and
# sacrifice is asked (CR 601.2h). Bot1 sacrifices first: Cosmogoyf goes with two cards in exile (Island and Plains, from
# its own cast), and only then, as the cast is committed, are two more exiled for Fling's life. Fling deals 2 to Bot2,
# the power Cosmogoyf last had on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Bolas's Citadel
Mox Emerald
Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator
Swamp
Cosmogoyf
Island
Plains
Fling
Mountain
Forest
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bolas's Citadel.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Library.Cosmogoyf.Cast
? Exile = Island; Plains
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cosmogoyf.Power = 2
Bot1.Library.Fling.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Sacrifice 1 permanent)
? Exile.Count = 2
Bot1.Choose(Cosmogoyf)
? Exile.Count = 4
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 4
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Fling; Cosmogoyf; Black Lotus
